From 92ee1406349187fc48f406ec9aae862497f0a7ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shahed Shaikh <shahedx.shaikh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Mar 2020 09:43:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] DRV_DPM_SW-184: FLM DPM enhance dp notifier callback

- do not maintain local list of event notifiers, use
  notifier list maintained by kernel which is RCU safe.
- add debugfs node to dump registered notifier clients
---
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath.h          |   3 +-
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath_api.c      |   2 -
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath_instance.c |   3 -
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath_notifier.c | 143 ++++++++++++++++++---------
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath_proc.c     |   3 +
 include/net/datapath_api.h                   |  66 ++++++++-----
 6 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 76 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath.h b/drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath.h
